    "updated_at": "2024-10-11T08:59:32Z",
    "body": "I had to read that statement a few times and am not sure I understand 🙂\r\n\r\nMaybe taking a step back, how can one omit a start tag that has attributes, if [attributes can only be set on start tags](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/syntax.html#syntax-attributes)?\r\n\r\nFrom going over the section it doesn’t look like it wouldn’t work without the sentence (or some rephrasing to make clear what omitting a start tag means in the context of attributes being present).\r\n\r\nEven if this was to miss something, the spec might get clearer by explaining it to everyone.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
