    "body": "Given this statement:\r\n\r\n> A [head](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/semantics.html#the-head-element) element's [start tag](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/syntax.html#syntax-start-tag) may be omitted if the element is empty, or if the first thing inside the [head](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/semantics.html#the-head-element) element is an element.\r\n\r\nIt's not at all clear that this only applies when the `head` element has no attributes. That's what that final statement is for.",
