    "body": "I think Jens is right: that statement as currently written isn’t correct. The actual _intent_ of the requirement regards whether the start tag’s _element_ has attributes — not about whether the start tag itself does. The problem with the text are currently written is the word _“it”_, which incorrectly refers to the start tag itself. So I’ve raised https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/10752 with an attempt at fixing that.",
